<title>FRANCE: Promodes 96 net attrib up 22 pct, div up.</title>
<headline>Promodes 96 net attrib up 22 pct, div up.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   1,247  vs	   1,022</p>
<p>    Net					    1,468  vs	   1,217</p>
<p>    Net dividend     (francs)		14	up 16.7 pct</p>
<p>    Operating				    2,384  vs	   2,186</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		 2,340  vs	   2,029</p>
<p>    Turnover overall			 168,024  vs 159,664</p>
<p>NOTE - The company issued the results in a statement and said they included an exceptional charge of 109 million francs for the sale of Promohypermarkt.</p>
<p>Promodes paid a net dividend of 12 francs in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
